# Carnival whack attendant dialogue

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.speaker=Whack Attendant
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.main_hub.body=Ready to whack some goblins? Ten gold coins starts a round. Bonk them when they pop up, then come back for summer festival tickets.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.main_hub.c_start=Start for 10 gold coins.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.main_hub.c_collect=I am here for my prize.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.main_hub.c_busy=Someone else is playing.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.main_hub.c_playing=How am I doing?
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.main_hub.c_get_club=I need a Goblin Whacker.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.main_hub.c_about=How does this work?
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.main_hub.c_goodbye=Maybe later.

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.about.body=Pay ten gold coins and I hand you a Goblin Whacker if you need one. Goblins pop up from the holes for about a minute. Hit them one at a time with that club, then talk to me for your tickets. More hits mean more tickets. Hit every goblin in a round and I will toss in a goblin backpack pattern for your town wardrobe.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.about.c_back=Got it.

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.game_started.body=Whistle is up! Use the Goblin Whacker when a goblin pops out. Come back when the round ends.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.game_started.c_ok=I am ready!

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.collect_result.body=Nice work! Here are your summer festival tickets for the goblins you hit.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.collect_result.c_ok=Thank you!

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.collect_perfect.body=Every goblin! Take your summer festival tickets, and this goblin backpack pattern for your town wardrobe. Use it to unlock the look, then dress a villager at the wardrobe.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.collect_perfect.c_ok=Thank you!

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.collect_perfect_already.body=Every goblin again! Here are your summer festival tickets. Your town already has the goblin backpack look unlocked.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.collect_perfect_already.c_ok=Thank you!

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.busy.body=Someone else is at the booth right now. Come back when they are done.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.busy.c_ok=I will wait.

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.playing.body=Keep swinging! Talk to me again when the round ends.
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.playing.c_ok=Back to it!

aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.got_club.body=Here is a Goblin Whacker. Swing true!
aetherhaven.dialogue.festival_carnival_whack.got_club.c_ok=Thanks!
